  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">local democracy ICLD 2008-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">lokal demokrati ICLD 2008-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internationellt centrum f&#xf6;r l&#xe4;rande f&#xf6;r lokal demokrati(ICLD)         bildades v&#xe5;ren 2008 och b&#xf6;rjade byggas upp under h&#xf6;sten samma &#xe5;r.     Uppdraget &#xe4;r att p&#xe5; olika s&#xe4;tt fr&#xe4;mja lokal demokrati i               utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder.ICLD &#xe4;r helt finansierat av Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Centre for Local Democracy (ICLD) was established   in 2008 and become operative from 2009. Their mission is to support   initiatives aimed to strengthen local democracy in the world          (developing countries and in former countries in Eastern              Europe/Soviet Union). ICLD works within three thematic spheres; i)    Municipal Partnerships, ii) ITP courses and iii) Knowledge Centre.</narrative>
  </description>
